.TH KLVTOOL 1 "2026-05-06" "klvtool 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
klvtool \- CLI for MPEG\-TS and KLV.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
klvtool <command> [flags]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
klvtool overview paragraph.
.SH "COMMANDS"
.TP
\fBklvtool\-decode\fR(1)
Decode KLV.
.TP
\fBklvtool\-inspect\fR(1)
Inspect MPEG\-TS.
.SH "WORKFLOWS"
.SS Triage a file
You just received a TS file.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
$ klvtool diagnose --input mission.ts
.fi
.RE
runs every stage
.SH "GLOSSARY"
.TP
\fBRaw checkpoint\fR
the per\-record artifact
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
success
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBklvtool\-decode\fR(1)
